 <_name>Promptline</_name>
 <_summary>A terminal with command prediction and an on-request agent</_summary>
 <description>
  <_p>
   Promptline is a traditional terminal that predicts the command you are
   about to type and, when you ask it with @agent, works on a task for you
   using what is already on your screen.
  </_p>
  <ul>
   <_li>Inline suggestions from your history and paths, instant and offline</_li>
   <_li>Optional model-based prediction using the directory, recent commands and their output</_li>
   <_li>@agent: ask a question or give a task from the prompt; every command it runs needs your approval</_li>
   <_li>With the AI features off, it is simply Terminator</_li>
  </ul>
  <_p>
   Promptline is based on Terminator, and keeps its grid layouts, tabs,
   broadcast typing, profiles and plugins.
  </_p>
 </description>
 <url type="homepage">https://github.com/MurcusM/promptline</url>
 <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/MurcusM/promptline/issues</url>
 <developer id="io.github.m_tek39">
  <name>Promptline contributors, building on the Terminator Team's work</name>
 </developer>
 <content_rating type="oars-1.1"/>
</component>
